[0.0002, "o", "44mIn double-quoted heredoc, \u001b[39m\u001b[23m\u001b[38;5;109m\\_\u001b[39m\u001b[3m\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[3m\u001b[38;5;244m is not a recognized escape, so it should be      \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n \u001b[3;38;5;244mpreserved. But the output shows it missing.\u001b[39m\u001b[23m                                   \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n                                                                               \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n \u001b[3m\u001b[38;5;244mWait, actually the display might be showing the backslash... let me look      \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n \u001b[3;38;5;244magain. Output:\u001b[39m\u001b[23m                                                                \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n                                                                               \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n \u001b[38;5;244m```\u001b[39m                                                                           \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n   \u001b[38;5;143m /_/\\\u001b[39m                                                                       \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n   \u001b[38;5;143m( o.o )  meow~\u001b[39m                                                              \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n   \u001b[38;5;143m > ^ <\u001b[39m                                                                      \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n \u001b[38;5;244m```\u001b[39m                                                                           \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n                                                                               \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n \u001b[3m\u001b[38;5;244mThe first line shows \u001b[39m\u001b[23m\u001b[38;5;109m /_/\\\u001b[39m\u001b[3m\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[3m\u001b[38;5;244m — the first backslash is missing. Hmm. Ruby        \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n \u001b[3;38;5;244mheredocs: \u001b[39m\u001b[23m\u001b[38;5;109m\\_\u001b[39m\u001b[3m\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[3m\u001b[38;5;244m — hmm, in Ruby, \u001b[39m\u001b[23m\u001b[38;5;109m\"\\ _\"\u001b[39m\u001b[3m\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[3m\u001b[38;5;244m — backslash followed by \u001b[39m\u001b[23m\u001b[38;5;109m_\u001b[39m\u001b[3m\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[3m\u001b[38;5;244m is not a valid   \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n \u001b[3;38;5;244mescape so it should stay. But in heredoc... Actually, \u001b[39m\u001b[23m\u001b[38;5;109m<<~\u001b[39m\u001b[3m\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[3m\u001b[38;5;244m heredoc: the        \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n \u001b[3;38;5;244mcontent is processed like a double-quoted string. In double-quoted strings,   \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n \u001b[3;38;5;244m\u001b[39m\u001b[23m\u001b[38;5;109m\\_\u001b[39m\u001b[3m\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[3m\u001b[38;5;244m isn't a recognized escape sequence, so it should remain \u001b[39m\u001b[23m\u001b[38;5;109m\\_\u001b[39m\u001b[3m\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[3m\u001b[38;5;244m. That's weird.\u001b[39m\u001b[23m  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n                                                                               \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n \u001b[3m\u001b[38;5;244mWait, maybe the tool output display dropped it? Let me verify by checking the \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n \u001b[3;38;5;244mraw output differently.\u001b[39m\u001b[23m                                                       \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n The backslash on the first line got eaten. Let me check:                      \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[48;5;17m                                                                               \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[48;5;17m \u001b[38;5;188m\u001b[1m$ \u001b[38;5;244m...\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\u001b[39m                                                                         \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[48;5;17m                                                                   